      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-01-22T03:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint at 10/8/8/1, won on the start of Plague Rat's third turn.</p>\n<p>La Comodora's first turn provided most of the ammunition I needed to win the game, but if I detailed the turn, it would rather give things away? So maybe I'll wait a few days and let people try it on their own first.</p>\n<p>It took me longer to stare at the opening board state and decide who got the first infection than anything else. I reluctantly gave it to La Comodora, with Stuntman&nbsp;and KNYFE getting the second and third. Omnitron wouldn't have survived it anyway.</p>",
