      "created_at": "2020-01-24T04:43:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, two of you have hit on one of the two major points that sped me to my victory: using LC's power turn one on the environment. Training Facility is bananas in this matchup - you won't have time to play all your cards anyway, and the extra power uses from La Comodora, Stuntman (off-turn!), and KNYFE&nbsp;are all very helpful.</p>\n<p>The other is ... unconventional and risky. And it wasn't what I intended to happen (even after thousands of games, I am still learning things about the mechanics!)&nbsp;But it helped.</p>",
